+# Native unchecked-unit validation v4
+
+Finite milestone complete, October 30, 2026. Native baseline:
+`a2de660d5467ce3611584768285b9227a1e2832b`; Verus implementation:
+`5929d1db8`. All prior v3 checked items and 35 inferred helpers remain checked.
+
+The original `UncheckedSigned::check`, `Validator::validate_unit` and
+`validate_unit_parents` executable bodies are unchanged and now checked. The
+returned value retains the actual input signable object and signature. Errors
+follow signature, session, maximum round, member count and existing control-hash
+priority. Cloned error payloads satisfy the checked clone relation; generic
+cloning is not assumed to preserve identity.
+
+`lawful_index` and `lawful_verification` are explicit opt-in semantic interfaces,
+false by default. FullUnit proves its index/session observations. An unrelated
+checked reference keychain proves accepted/rejected signature paths. This is a
+conditional verification-interface theorem, not certification of a cryptographic
+implementation or every value constructible through Signed's Decode impl.
+Hashing, AsRef and locking retain their opaque result boundaries. Positive-round
+arithmetic retains v3's `members <= usize::MAX / 2` domain. Initial hash comparison
+retains its actual opaque comparison meaning.
+
+The acceptance replay has 204 verified results, zero errors, 39 exact helpers
+with all 117 mandatory certificates proved, and 125 checked executable bodies
+plus one existing generated proof body. The universal order goal covers all
+branches, including simultaneous faults; a second goal builds a positive-round
+unit through the original constructors and proves acceptance. Seven deliberate
+semantic mutations fail ordinary application verification while helper
+certificates remain healthy. No-verify and filtered publication are rejected.
+Restored source passes a fresh full replay. Native tests: 192 unit tests and one
+doctest. Verus inference regression tests: 285 passing; vstd: 2,215 verified.
+
+The parsed source comparison finds all 179 comparable original bodies unchanged.
+The sole Rust structural refactor splits FullUnit's constructor into a selected
+impl block; its body is unchanged. PreUnit and ControlHash Clone exclusions were
+removed and their derives checked. No serializer or other exclusion was added.
+Signed, UncheckedSigned and SignatureError codec derive bodies are checked
+against typed-only codec declarations; no encoding equation is supplied.
+
+Durable evidence, original/accepted syntax inventories, exact commands, full
+stdout/stderr, source hashes, assumptions and accepted source archive are in the
+Verus repository at `evidence/verus-infer-validation-v4`. The original v3 fixture
+and fixed engine were left unchanged. This acceptance was checked locally by the
+implementing agent; no new independent-agent audit is claimed. No push was made.
